utious, it would have survived.**"],["fall through","**Projects fall through when trust is lost.**"]],"cap":"Resumo da Unidade 3 do C1"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"He could distinguish outbreaks ___ noise. (from)","a":"from","why":"distinguish from."},{"s":"Were the lab quiet, I ___ hear the data. (would)","a":"would","why":"hipótese presente."},{"s":"___ and large, the proposal is solid. (By)","a":"By","why":"expressão do plano."},{"s":"I will do ___ the second table. (without)","a":"without","why":"passar sem."},{"s":"___ funding to stop, we would lose forty years of data. (Were)","a":"Were","why":"inversão."},{"s":"___ you submit an ethics statement, your file will not be reviewed. (Unless)","a":"Unless","why":"unless."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["viral strain","cepa viral"],["epidemiologist","epidemiologista"],["treatment guideline","diretriz de tratamento"],["patchy data","dados incompletos"],["statistical noise","ruído estatístico"],["disease outbreak","surto de doença"]]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Unit word bank","blocks":[{"type":"words","items":[["disease outbreak","surto de doença"],["statistical noise","ruído estatístico"],["patchy data","dados incompletos"],["treatment guideline","diretriz de tratamento"],["epidemiologist","epidemiologista"],["viral strain","cepa viral"],["public health alert","alerta de saúde pública"],["infection rate","taxa de infecção"],["outbreak map","mapa do surto"],["case cluster","conjunto de casos"],["contact tracing","rastreamento de contatos"],["surveillance system","sistema de vigilância"],["data artifact","artefato de dados"],["signal detection","detecção de sinal"],["field investigation","investigação de campo"],["health authority","autoridade de saúde"],["modeling team","equipe de modelagem"],["transmission route","via de transmissão"],["incubation pe